This module contains AIDL interface definitions and supporting classes for the
Meshrabiya mesh networking service. The AIDL interfaces are used for inter-process
communication between Meshrabiya service providers and client applications.

AIDL Interface Files:
- IMeshrabiyaService.aidl: Main service interface for mesh networking operations
- Supporting Parcelable classes for data exchange

